## 2. Gitoxide (`gix` / `ein`) — Pure Rust Git Implementation

Gitoxide provides native-speed repository inspection, directory walks, and object database queries without libgit2 or C-Git process spawns.

### Key Commands
```bash
# High-speed status computation (thousands of files/sec)
gix status

# Verify repository integrity and object database
gix verify

# Check commit-graph files
gix commit-graph verify

# Fast directory walk ignoring excluded patterns
gix dirwalk
```

