## 3. Sovereign Local Forge (`frg`) — Local Monorepo Forge

Located at `C:\src\vcs\forge` (CLI shim: `C:\Users\aphro\.local\bin\frg.cmd`).
Combines Jujutsu stacked diffs, Gitoxide inspection, Blake3 + Zstd patch bundles, local reviews, and zero-overhead CI into a pure Bun 1.4.4 server and CLI.

### CLI Usage
```bash
# Status of all C:\src repos or single repo stack
frg status
frg status C:\src\vcs\forge

# Export content-addressed Blake3 + Zstd patch bundle
frg bundle C:\src\vcs\forge C:\src\vcs\forge\patch.frg.json

# Verify bundle cryptographic integrity
frg verify patch.frg.json

# Apply patch bundle cleanly
frg sync patch.frg.json C:\src\target-repo

# Slim repository (commit-graph, reflog expire, pack index)
frg slim C:\src\vcs\gitoxide

# Run local CI pipeline without GitHub Actions
frg ci C:\src\vcs\forge "bun test"

# Launch dark-mode Web Dashboard & REST API
frg serve --port 4000
```

### Forge Endpoints
- `GET /`: Dark-mode terminal-inspired monorepo dashboard.
- `GET /api/repos`: Scanned active repositories, branch, dirty status.
- `GET /api/stacks?repo=<path>`: Jujutsu stacked commits.
- `GET /api/reviews` & `POST /api/reviews`: Sovereign local code reviews.
- `GET /api/ci` & `POST /api/ci`: Zero-overhead CI task executor.
- `GET /api/bundles`: Blake3 content-addressed patch bundle ledger.

