## 4. Task Orchestration with `just`

`just` (`C:\src\vcs\just`, binary in PATH) provides deterministic command orchestration without makefile quirks.

### Authoring Patterns (`justfile`)
```just
set shell := ["powershell", "-NoProfile", "-Command"]

# Default recipe
default:
    just --list

# Ingest monorepo targets with parameters
ingest target="depot" format="markdown":
    depot ingest "C:\src\{{target}}" --format "{{format}}"

# Run byte-level repo slimming
slim target="forge":
    frg slim "C:\src\vcs\{{target}}"
```

### Bun Integration (`@sovereign/bun-plugins/just-plugin.ts`)
Allows direct TypeScript importing of `.just` recipes as typed callable async functions:
```ts
import { slim, ingest } from "./justfile";
await slim({ target: "depot" });
```

